.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PATHCHK 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pathchk \- Check whether file names are valid or portable
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBpathchk\fR [OPTION]... NAME...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Check whether file names are valid or portable
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-p\fR
check for most POSIX systems
.TP
\fB\-P\fR
check for empty names and leading "\-"
.TP
\fB\-\-portability\fR
check for all POSIX systems (equivalent to \-p \-P)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
